<b>Gineko Ouka     Real Name: Bonnie (Female)</b>

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.850
You min/max burnouts 
are screwed in the head.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.980
God, they're so irritating and stupid!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.550
I wouldn't party with you if you paid me!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.360
Delivery!

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:31.860
Took them long enough.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.570
Could you be any slower? Damn...

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:39.830
Hi... I'll sign for it right away, 
so if you could just leave the—

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.830
Hi! Good afternoon. Nice to meet you.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.710
We're just going to intrude 
for a couple of years.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:52.830
This place is a dump! Couldn't you 
have found a nicer place, Miku?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.840
It'll be a normal house, 
once it's all cleaned up.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.760
This is actually on the nicer side of what 
I could find, so stop being so picky.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:01.350
Hey, can I shower now?

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.600
You might want to hold off...

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.570
since things are about to get messy.

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.020
Good point.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.770
You know, I'm pretty fragile,

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:21.480
so having a human stab me 
like that actually does hurt.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:27.480
The thing is, I happen to love having 
a body that can feel pain so easily!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.010
It lets me enjoy the most 
brutal pain and intense ecstasy...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.840
A total visceral package!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:38.000
Female. Lives alone. Recluse.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.840
Easy there. Don't make a fuss.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:42.080
Does all shopping via delivery. 
No friends or relatives, distant or otherwise.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.540
Has assets thanks to her parents,

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:46.170
who died in an accident and left her
enough money to live like a shut-in.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:49.730
Homeowner. And that's why we picked her.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.950
Her passwords and account information 
are all sitting in her inbox.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:55.740
Uses her birthday for her cash
 and credit card PINs.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.860
We won't even need to question her!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.110
It'll be okay.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.670
Merku, go ahead and kill her.

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:02.450
What? Already?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.300
This should be a piece of cake.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:06.520
All I have to do is play the 
role of a nerd on the internet

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.040
and keep posting on a blog 
that no one is reading...

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:11.460
Then we just nibble through 
her savings a bit at a time.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.430
She'll be fully replaced.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.360
If you want to get mad, maybe be mad 
about the fact that your hollow joke

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:19.970
of a life didn't amount 
to much more than that.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.720
Since the surgery is underway,

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:27.350
allow me to explain the powers of 
the devil in white, Merku-chan!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:31.160
I can deftly control my tentacles 
within a one-meter range.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:34.140
They're not much use in a fight, 
but when it comes to surgery,

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:36.000
I can do the work of twelve doctors at once.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.860
You want a prescription? Well, don't ask me!

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:42.390
I've assisted His Demonic Lordship 
in addition to Dr. Umeyo,

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.880
but I actually know less 
than your typical nurse.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:47.780
I'm just an assistant!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.630
That about covers it!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.050
What do you think, Miku?

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:57.730
I get the feeling your body and face 
are both hotter than the original...

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:00.970
but since you'll just be accepting 
deliveries, it's probably fine.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.490
I have to put on someone's 
skin just to answer the door?

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.850
What a pain.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.900
What about everything other 
than her face and fingerprints?

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.590
Everything else can go.

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.540
Umeyo, could you eat it up?

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.320
You want me to eat a human? Whole?!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:17.280
I'd rather not. They don't taste very good.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.970
So, what do we do now, Miku?

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:28.160
For now, it's probably best not 
to do much other than live in peace.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.190
I can take that shower, then?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:31.170
Go on ahead.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:35.590
And in a few years, we can 
rendezvous with the Demon Lord...

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.340
So, what the hell are we doing now, Kuraishi?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:44.590
Good question... I'm honestly not sure.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.600
What the shit is that supposed to mean?!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.080
I can't think of a way
 to contact the Demon Lord.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.910
And the Idaten are playing for keeps.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.860
You heard they've got Neput 
and Piscalat on their side, right?

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.500
Which means they know all about 
our emergency contact methods.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.610
I tried passing along a 
message using a human, but...

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.520
Hey, wanna do a little job for me?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.740
I'll make it worth your while.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.710
Call this number in three hours.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:10.750
Yeah?

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.920
Then you just repeat 
what I'm about to tell you...

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.760
<i>Who is this?</i>

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.530
W-Well, I'm just calling 
because someone asked me to...

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:24.460
The guy who hired me is listening
and he wants me to tell you something.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:29.230
<i>A wise decision. They're listening 
in on this as we speak.</i>

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:34.110
<i>Right now, the survivors are Miku, 
Merku, Kuraishi, Buzz, Raki,</i>

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:37.930
<i>Umeyo, Meliano, Kroft and 
Ferlandia. Those nine.</i>

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.890
<i>They already know that, as well.</i>

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.000
<i>Seems time's up.</i>

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.610
<i>That was certainly fast...</i>

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.500
We're with the police.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:50.000
We'd like to talk to you for a minute.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.220
W-Wait, I didn't do...

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.500
Now, now...

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.650
We just want to talk.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.690
But that guy asked me...

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:58.380
Those are cops from another country... 
and they got here so quickly.

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:01.620
Just how deep in human 
society are these guys?

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:09.120
So if we tell His Lordship where we are,
 it's as good as telling the Idaten?

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.640
The Demon Lord mentioned 
demons who managed to escape.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:16.170
And of those demons, the one most likely 
to find a way out of this mess

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.320
has to be Miku.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.760
So, how are we going to 
contact the Demon Lord?

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.950
That's a secret.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:26.130
If I wanted to, I could get 
ahold of him in a few days,

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.750
but it'd be best to wait a few years

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:31.190
until they're distracted 
with something else...

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:33.990
So, for now, let's just 
enjoy the leisurely life.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.210
<b>A few years later, on a deserted island
Buzz & Meliano</b>

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.630
You damned—

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.430
Buzz, stop it! Please, stop!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.860
Let go of me, Meliano! 
That thing is nothing but a monster!

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:53.180
You're wrong! 
That's no monster! It's a child!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.650
Our child!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:59.260
Luce, wait! Don't go! Please, come back!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.530
Don't get any closer!
 It'll eat more than your arm next!

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:13.120
It's no use... Without the Demon Lord,
 we're totally worthless.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.750
Nothing more than monsters...
